---
/**
 * Front page · opportunity announcements in the lab's Discord server.
 *
 * Three threads stand in a stack, each from one of the lab's forums. As the
 * section crosses the viewport (`--p`) they slide forward out of depth one at
 * a time, the oldest first, so the newest call lands in front. The front
 * thread is a whole announcement: what the call is, the checks, who should
 * look (project teams, by name) and the four buttons. Behind it, a conference
 * thread that leads with its place and continent, and a changed call whose
 * thread was updated rather than posted again.
 *
 * The buttons are live but local: they show what each does without sending
 * anything. Drawn in the site's own vocabulary, not Discord's; the platform is
 * named in words only. Static: the stack, composed and still.
 */
---

<section id="announcements" class="nf-section af" data-proto="announce-forum" aria-labelledby="announce-forum-heading" data-progress>
  <div class="nf-wrap af-grid">
    <div class="af-copy reveal">
      <p class="nf-eyebrow">In your lab's Discord server</p>
      <h2 id="announce-forum-heading" class="nf-h2">New calls arrive where the lab already talks</h2>
      <p class="nf-sub">
        Each grant, fellowship and conference that fits the lab becomes its own thread in the server's
        forums, so the discussion about a call stays with the call.
      </p>
      <ul class="af-facts">
        <li><strong>One thread per call.</strong> When a call changes, Mylo updates its thread and says what moved, rather than posting it again.</li>
        <li><strong>Who should look.</strong> The project teams it suits, by name.</li>
        <li><strong>Anyone can be reminded.</strong> Remind me works for everyone in the server, with no Mycelium account.</li>
        <li><strong>Conferences lead with the place,</strong> and every thread is tagged by continent.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="af-stage" data-pointer>
      <!-- Back: a changed call, updated in place. -->
      <article class="af-thread af-back" style="--i:0" aria-label="Sample thread: an updated grant">
        <header class="af-th-head">
          <p class="af-forum"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span>grants</p>
          <span class="af-tag af-tag-updated">Updated</span>
        </header>
        <p class="af-th-title">R21 Exploratory/Developmental Research Award</p>
        <p class="af-th-line">
          <img src="/images/mylo-head-96.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18" loading="lazy" />
          The call changed: its next round now closes in <span class="af-gold">11 days</span>. This thread is up to date.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Middle: a conference, place first. -->
      <article class="af-thread af-mid" style="--i:1" aria-label="Sample thread: a conference">
        <header class="af-th-head">
          <p class="af-forum"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span>conferences</p>
          <span class="af-tag">North America</span>
        </header>
        <p class="af-th-place">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 17s5-4.6 5-8.5a5 5 0 0 0-10 0C5 12.4 10 17 10 17z"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8.5" r="1.8"></circle></svg>
          Washington DC, USA
        </p>
        <p class="af-th-title">AMIA Annual Symposium</p>
        <p class="af-th-line">Submit by <span class="af-gold">58 days from now</span> · the submission deadline, not the event date.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Front: the newest call, whole. -->
      <article class="af-thread af-front" style="--i:2" aria-label="Sample thread: a new grant announcement" data-af-front>
        <header class="af-th-head">
          <p class="af-forum"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span>grants</p>
          <span class="af-tag af-tag-new">New</span>
        </header>
        <div class="af-post">
          <img class="af-av" src="/images/mylo-head-96.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="af-post-body">
            <p class="af-by">Mylo</p>
            <p class="af-th-title af-big">Smart Health and Biomedical Research in the Era of AI</p>
            <p class="af-src">National Science Foundation · <span class="af-money">$1.2M / 4 yrs</span></p>

            <p class="af-deadline">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"></circle><path d="M10 6v4l2.5 2"></path></svg>
              Closes in 46 days
            </p>

            <p class="af-why">
              Funds the community-hospital evaluation your Lakeside work has been waiting on, and asks for exactly the
              grounding failure analysis the lab already runs.
            </p>

            <dl class="af-checks">
              <div><dt>Open</dt><dd>Accepting applications</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Deadline</dt><dd>Clear of your 14-day buffer</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Who may apply</dt><dd>US institutions</dd></div>
            </dl>

            <p class="af-look">
              <span class="af-look-h">Who should look</span>
              <span class="af-team">Lakeside deployment</span>
              <span class="af-team">MIMIC harness</span>
            </p>

            <div class="af-btns">
              <button type="button" class="af-btn" data-af-act="interested" aria-pressed="false">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 16.5s-6-3.6-6-8a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 6-2.2 3.4 3.4 0 0 1 6 2.2c0 4.4-6 8-6 8z"></path></svg>
                Interested <span class="af-count" data-af-count>2</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="af-btn" data-af-act="remind" aria-pressed="false">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 13.5V9a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4.5l1.3 1.5H4.7z M8.5 17h3"></path></svg>
                Remind me
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="af-btn" data-af-act="no" aria-pressed="false">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l8 8M14 6l-8 8"></path></svg>
                Not for us
              </button>
              <span class="af-btn af-btn-link">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5H5v10h10v-3 M11 4h5v5 M16 4l-7 7"></path></svg>
                View the call
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="af-ephemeral" data-af-note aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <p class="af-sample">Sample threads · fictional lab</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  /*
    The buttons show what each does, here and nowhere else: nothing is sent.
    Scoped to this prototype's root.
  */
  (function () {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-proto="announce-forum"]').forEach(function (root) {
      var note = root.querySelector("[data-af-note]");
      var count = root.querySelector("[data-af-count]");
      var notes = {
        interested: "Counted. The thread shows who in the lab is interested.",
        remind: "Only you can see this: Mylo will remind you before the call closes. No account needed.",
        no: "Marked not for us.",
      };
      root.querySelectorAll("[data-af-act]").forEach(function (b) {
        b.addEventListener("click", function () {
          var act = b.getAttribute("data-af-act");
          var on = b.getAttribute("aria-pressed") !== "true";
          b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", on ? "true" : "false");
          if (act === "interested") count.textContent = on ? "3" : "2";
          note.textContent = on ? notes[act] : "";
          note.hidden = !on;
        });
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .af {
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .af-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .af-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .af-facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-facts li {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .af-facts li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.62em;
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--nf-glow);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgb(184 217 154 / 60%);
  }

  .af-facts strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------ the stack */

  .af-stage {
    --pv: var(--p, 0.6);
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    padding-top: 7.5rem;
    perspective: 1400px;
    perspective-origin: 50% 0%;
  }

  .af-thread {
    /* Oldest first, newest last: each slides forward out of depth. */
    --e: clamp(0, calc((var(--pv) - 0.1 - var(--i) * 0.08) / 0.24), 1);
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    opacity: min(1, calc(0.1 + var(--e) * 2.4));
    transform:
      translate3d(calc(var(--mx, 0) * var(--sway)), calc(var(--y) - (1 - var(--e)) * 40px), calc(var(--z) - (1 - var(--e)) * 260px))
      rotateX(calc(var(--my, 0) * -2deg));
    transform-origin: 50% 0;
  }

  .af-back {
    --y: -7.5rem;
    --z: -150px;
    --sway: -4px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 70%, var(--nf-night));
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);
  }

  .af-mid {
    --y: -3.9rem;
    --z: -75px;
    --sway: 3px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 85%, var(--nf-night));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgb(0 0 0 / 40%);
  }

  .af-front {
    --y: 0px;
    --z: 0px;
    --sway: 9px;
    box-shadow:
      0 40px 90px rgb(0 0 0 / 55%),
      0 0 0 1px rgb(184 217 154 / 6%) inset;
  }

  /* The threads behind show their head only; the rest is covered. */
  .af-back,
  .af-mid {
    padding-bottom: 14rem;
  }

  .af-th-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem 0;
  }

  .af-forum {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .af-tag {
    padding: 0.08rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .af-tag-new {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-primary) 50%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-primary) 20%, transparent);
    color: var(--nf-glow);
  }

  .af-tag-updated {
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .af-th-title {
    margin: 0.35rem 1rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .af-th-place {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.4rem 1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .af-th-place svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--nf-glow);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }

  .af-mid .af-th-title {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-th-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.3rem 1rem 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .af-th-line img {
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .af-gold {
    color: var(--brand-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------ the front thread */

  .af-post {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .af-av {
    flex: none;
    width: 2.1rem;
    height: 2.1rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: #253021;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgb(184 217 154 / 25%);
  }

  .af-post-body {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .af-by {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .af-big {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .af-src {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-money {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .af-deadline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-accent-soft) 70%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f2e3c2;
  }

  .af-deadline svg {
    width: 0.95rem;
    height: 0.95rem;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--brand-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .af-why {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-checks {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(8.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .af-checks div {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 2%);
  }

  .af-checks dt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .af-checks dt::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--nf-glow);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .af-checks dd {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .af-look {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .af-look-h {
    margin-right: 0.2rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .af-team {
    padding: 0.1rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-secondary) 22%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .af-btns {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .af-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    min-height: 2.2rem;
    padding: 0 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--surface-alt);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      transform 120ms ease,
      box-shadow 120ms ease,
      background-color 200ms ease;
  }

  .af-btn svg {
    width: 0.95rem;
    height: 0.95rem;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  button.af-btn:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-primary) 50%, var(--border));
  }

  button.af-btn:active,
  .af-btn[aria-pressed="true"] {
    transform: translateY(2px);
    box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);
  }

  .af-btn[aria-pressed="true"] {
    border-color: var(--brand-primary);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-primary) 28%, var(--surface-alt));
  }

  .af-btn-link {
    cursor: default;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-count {
    min-width: 1.1rem;
    padding: 0 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgb(184 217 154 / 14%);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .af-ephemeral {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-primary);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    background: rgb(184 217 154 / 6%);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .af-sample {
    grid-area: 2 / 1;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .af-post {
      padding-inline: 0.8rem;
    }

    .af-av {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .af-thread {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate3d(0, var(--y), var(--z));
    }

    .af-btn {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
